url: "https://THUROI0787.github.io/absent-author/"
abstract: >-
  Absent Author is an evidence list and two agent skills for spotting research papers
  that AI produced with no responsible human author. The list holds 83 sourced items in
  four layers (language, structure, research, artifacts) plus signs of a present author.
  The paper-author-pass skill helps authors check an AI-assisted paper before submission;
  the paper-slop-screen skill helps reviewers grade writing (W), research steering (R) and
  quality (Q) with a location and a quote for every finding, and no AI probability.
keywords: [peer review, AI-generated papers, research integrity, LLM, agent skills]
